  "prefLabel": "Cor 504.05 Rights of All Residents of the SPU",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 504.05 Rights of All Residents of the SPU. Persons committed or transferred to the unit who are convicted offenders, persons found not guilty because of insanity, pre-trial detainees, or persons civilly committed, shall retain all their individual rights, subject to those restrictions that are inherent with confinement within a secure forensic setting.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 500) #12793, eff 5-25-19",
